{"ID":"20240506110123-fu5ndi9","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506110123-fu5ndi9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506110123-fu5ndi9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240704135022-6btj26a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614111824-5yhxmla\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2400\u0026#125;","title":"368补11鸡矢白（鸡屎白）","type":"doc","updated":"20240828141227"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240704135022-6btj26a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704135022-6btj26a","updated":"20240704135022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704135022-nb0p5ti.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240614111820-2kv4ddf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111820-2kv4ddf","updated":"20240828141225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 599px;","style":"width: 589px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡-20240703104031-nn2qyj1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 589px;\" parent-style=\"width: 599px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 611px;","style":"width: 601px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡2-20240703104124-y3bgjhy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 601px;\" parent-style=\"width: 611px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704140134-wgsqht8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704140134-wgsqht8","updated":"20240828141226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 851px;","style":"width: 841px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡2-20240704140134-wmlmhge.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 841px;\" parent-style=\"width: 851px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704135754-b56d890","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704135754-b56d890","updated":"20240828141227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 852px;","style":"width: 842px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡-20240704135754-gnczc62.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 842px;\" parent-style=\"width: 852px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240614111820-mgszrku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111820-mgszrku","updated":"20240704135533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为鸡的粪便的白色部分。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111820-vfjdlni","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111820-vfjdlni"}},{"ID":"20240614112053-sp1k98f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614112053-sp1k98f","updated":"20240614112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡屎白《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240614112053-eyxxmmf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112053-eyxxmmf","updated":"20240614112053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】无。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112053-9redzkq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112053-9redzkq","updated":"20240614112053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"微寒，入足太阳膀胱经。利水而泻湿，达木而舒筋。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112053-os10226","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112053-os10226","updated":"20240614112053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《金匮》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鸡屎白散"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"鸡屎白。为散，水服方寸匕。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治转筋为病，臂脚直，脉上下，微弦，转筋入腹。筋司于肝，水寒土湿，肝木不舒，筋脉挛缩，则病转筋。鸡屎白利水道而泻湿寒，则木达而筋舒也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112053-lgbqap9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112053-lgbqap9","updated":"20240614112053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《素问·腹中论》：有病心腹满，旦食则不能暮食，名为鼓胀。治之以鸡矢醴，一剂知，二剂已。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112053-sjtvcic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112053-sjtvcic","updated":"20240614112053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其性神于泻水，一切淋沥黄疸之证皆医。兼能化瘀破结，善磨癥瘕而消痈肿，敷瘰疬而涂鼠瘘。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112053-ohrf2zx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112053-ohrf2zx","updated":"20240614112053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白鸡者良，腊月收之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111820-4zqn859","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111820-4zqn859"}},{"ID":"20240614112043-mc76vuf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614112043-mc76vuf","updated":"20240614112047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡屎白《要药分剂》"}]},{"ID":"20240614112043-583w13v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112043-583w13v","updated":"20240614112043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦。性微寒。无毒。雄鸡屎乃有白。腊月预收之。白鸡乌骨者更良。素问作鸡矢。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112043-mvu4puc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112043-mvu4puc","updated":"20240614112043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主消渴。伤寒寒热。（本经）破石淋。及转筋。利小便。止遗溺。灭瘢痕。（别录）治器）下气【归经】入胃大肠二经。为治水消胀气除积之品。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112043-rpgnrkg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112043-rpgnrkg","updated":"20240614112043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【前论】仲淳曰。王太仆云。本草鸡矢。并不治蛊胀。但能利小便。盖蛊胀皆生于湿热。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112043-spdf6ul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112043-spdf6ul","updated":"20240614112043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胀治鳌按、蛊胀由湿热而生。固已。然亦有因积滞而成者。屎白不但通利下泄。使湿热尽从小便也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111820-skmgxpx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111820-skmgxpx"}},{"ID":"20240614112034-wxbpz5z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614112034-wxbpz5z","updated":"20240614112038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡屎白《本草易读》"}]},{"ID":"20240614112034-0ewutt8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112034-0ewutt8","updated":"20240614112034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（雄鸡屎有白，腊月收之。白鸡乌骨者更良。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112034-4ypxdjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112034-4ypxdjd","updated":"20240614112034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"微寒，无毒。消鼓胀而破症瘕，利二便而止遗尿，解石淋而止转筋，息诸风而灭瘢痕。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112034-9uvacot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112034-9uvacot","updated":"20240614112034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疗诸消灭瘢痕，以猪脂饲乌公鸡三日，取白屎同白芷、当归煎十沸，去渣，入鹰屎白调敷之。（验方第一。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112034-csy687a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112034-csy687a","updated":"20240614112034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"耳中恶疮，烧研敷之。（第二。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112034-0bbzu3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112034-0bbzu3l","updated":"20240614112034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内痈未成，烧研水下。（第三。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112034-re79z60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112034-re79z60","updated":"20240614112034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小儿惊啼，焙末饮下。（第四。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112034-g8m5csh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112034-g8m5csh","updated":"20240614112034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腹胀尿涩，脉实沉，炒末酒下。（第五。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111820-1cokw7j","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111820-1cokw7j"}},{"ID":"20240614112025-wh6l4ny","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614112025-wh6l4ny","updated":"20240614112029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡屎白《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614112025-pm696yj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112025-pm696yj","updated":"20240614112025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"微寒。下气消积。利二便，治臌胀。（羯鸡干粪炒黄，酒煮三分之一，去渣服，腹转胀自消。）除胀，酒渍。消积利便，炒黄，水煎。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112025-82xgzx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112025-82xgzx6","updated":"20240614112025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怪症∶脚肚或遍身肉窠处生疮毒，渐即内肉翻出，但红亮而无脓血，饮食不进，疼痛欲绝，名翻花石榴。用烂溏鸡屎时时抹之自愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111820-enhippk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111820-enhippk"}},{"ID":"20240614111859-6le9vcu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-6le9vcu","updated":"20240614111921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡矢白《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-q9oxhgf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-q9oxhgf","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄鸡矢乃有白。腊月收之。白鸡乌骨者更良。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-9yswk1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-9yswk1t","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味微寒。主治中风失音。及白虎风贼风。风痹破血。和黑豆炒。酒浸。服之疗破伤中附方反胃吐食。取乌骨鸡勿与食。止与水饮。四五日。将五蒲蛇二条竹刀切饲之。待下粪中温服外。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-5iuz76w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-5iuz76w","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"直。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-snil14g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-snil14g","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"弓升。少小五合。日二服。转筋入腹。其人背脚直。其脉上下微弦。用鸡矢白为末。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-auadbhc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-auadbhc","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寸匕。温服。阴毒腹痛。鸡矢白乌豆地肤子各一把。乱发一团。同炒烟起。倾入好酒一碗浸之。去渣热服。即止。石淋疼痛。鸡矢白晒半干。炒香为末。以酸浆汤和服方寸匕。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-79y4ond","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-79y4ond","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日二。当下石出。心腹鳖瘕及宿症。并猝得症。以饭饲白雄鸡取粪。同小便于瓦器中熬黄为末。每用温酒服方寸匕。日四五服。或杂饭食之。以消为度。耳聋不听。鸡矢白炒半升。乌豆炒一升。以无灰酒二升。乘热投入服。取汗。耳如鼓鼙。勿讶。诸方所治。是皆本巽木之气。而为土致其用。却由巽伏于兑。更得致木之用于土也。故取其肠胃转化而出者（色白属金）任之。且矢独雄鸡有白。即可明于气化之义。气属阳故也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-0vl3rej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-0vl3rej","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕素问以鸡矢醴治鼓胀。非止为通利而用。其本有在通利之先者。夫肝属风木。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-fk9waen","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-fk9waen","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其所胜之并不肺金主气互为化之还取为气伏。即矢"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-lnjvj2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-lnjvj2b","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卵"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-zv80kfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-zv80kfo","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄鸡者为上。乌鸡次之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-jdz5pk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-jdz5pk5","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘平。卵白象天。其气清。其性微寒。卵黄象地。其气浑。其性温。故白能清气。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-teekl0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-teekl0o","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治伏热。黄能补血。全卵则合而有之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-uumdg8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-uumdg8j","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"附方小儿疳痢腹胀。用鸡子开孔。入巴豆一粒。轻粉一钱。用纸五十重。裹饭上蒸三度。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-zr9p6g6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-zr9p6g6","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"及火歇气。经一宿定。如日多者。三日贴之。一日一易。至瘥乃止。此方秽恶。不可施之贵人。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-ibjw46y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-ibjw46y","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但诸方皆不能及。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-hjh0l20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-hjh0l20","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡子白"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-yb7i8ph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-yb7i8ph","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘。气微寒。主治目热赤痛。除心下伏热。止烦满咳逆。和赤小豆。涂一切丹肿腮痛。神效。汤火烧烫。鸡子清和酒调洗。勤洗生肌。或生敷之亦可。产后血下。取白一枚。入醋一半搅服。产后血晕。身痉直口目向上。牵急不知人。取鸡子清调芥末二钱。即安。乌鸡子尤良。横生倒产。鸡子白同人参汤。加乳香丹砂研末。入姜反胃呕吐。鸡子白同人参。加粟米薤白煮粥食。胃寒气喘。不能传化水谷者。人同鸡子清加生附生姜服。蛔虫攻心。口吐清水。用鸡子去黄。纳好漆入壳中。和吞之。虫即出也。咽塞鼻疮。及干呕头痛食不下。用鸡子开孔。去黄。着米醋白炖沸。取下更炖。如此三次。乘热饮之。不过一二度即愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-bqu76n8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-bqu76n8","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕鸡子白象天。其气清。每用之以清气。及观治产后血闭血晕诸证。又觉清气不足概且止二鸡子清为功。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-gh5vr3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-gh5vr3m","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所治诸产后之"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-r4y7h4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-r4y7h4k","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卵黄"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-y5dk61f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-y5dk61f","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘温。兹味为阴中之阴。功能补血。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111859-6a1jtjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111859-6a1jtjm","updated":"20240614111859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"附方妊娠下痢绞痛。用乌鸡子开孔。去白留黄。入黄丹一钱在内。浓纸裹定。泥固。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111820-bf05yjr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111820-bf05yjr"}},{"ID":"20240614111821-dl9mfpt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-dl9mfpt","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡屎白"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-nvmw8st","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-nvmw8st","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-1s6ili7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-1s6ili7","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Jī Shǐ Bái"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-2rpdxpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-2rpdxpl","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-9rb2v5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-9rb2v5x","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 鸡矢（《素问》），鸡子粪（《本草经集注》），鸡粪（《千金方》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-gighvwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-gighvwl","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-4k7ybsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-4k7ybsd","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-gshrj5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-gshrj5m","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-63kpa1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-63kpa1r","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为雉科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"家鸡粪便上的白色部分"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-iwj0q99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-iwj0q99","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-6ndxgfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-6ndxgfe","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《长沙药解》：\"入膀胱经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-0d457a3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-0d457a3","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-qk33g1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-qk33g1l","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦咸，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-93zbzhy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-93zbzhy","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"微寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-j3p59zp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-j3p59zp","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"微寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-mx1be73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-mx1be73","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《医林纂要》：\"苦咸，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-w63pqb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-w63pqb9","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-x4dqc0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-x4dqc0f","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 利水，泄热，祛风，解毒。治臌胀积聚，黄疸，淋病，风痹，破伤中风，筋脉挛急。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-0jz99r7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-0jz99r7","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主消渴，伤寒，寒热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-yn7omwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-yn7omwu","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"破石淋及转筋，利小便，止遗溺，灭瘢痕。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-tc4th84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-tc4th84","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草拾遗》：\"和黑豆炒浸酒，主贼风、风痹，破血。\"又：\"炒服之，主虫咬毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-9fr5oqw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-9fr5oqw","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》：\"治中风失音，淡（痰）逆，消渴，破石淋，利小肠余沥，敷疮痍，灭瘢痕。炒服，治小儿客忤。朱雄鸡粪治白虎风，并敷痛风。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-1rxkm86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-1rxkm86","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《品汇精要》：\"丹雄鸡屎白敷蛐蟮咬良，又烧研水服方寸匕，疗食药中毒，发狂、闷、吐下欲死，及疗妒乳并乳头破裂及痈肿。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-jhipzts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-jhipzts","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《纲目》：\"下气，通利大小便，治心腹鼓胀，消癥瘕。以水淋汁服，解金银毒。以醋和涂蜈蚣、蚯蚓咬毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-xscum1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-xscum1u","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-zphpm94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-zphpm94","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：晒干，文火焙炒，炒时洒入白酒少许，研末为丸散，1～2钱，或浸酒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-r5f75mo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-r5f75mo","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-gtrmhry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-gtrmhry","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治鼓胀心腹满，旦食则不能暮食：腊月干鸡矢白半斤。袋盛，以酒醅一斗，渍七日。温服三杯，日三；或为末服二钱亦可。（《素问》鸡矢醴。用量、制法、服法据《纲目》引何大英补）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-0fexrut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-0fexrut","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治鼓胀、气胀、水胀：羯鸡屎一升.研细，炒焦色，地上出火毒再研细，百沸汤三升淋汁。每服一大盏，调木香、槟榔末各-钱，日三服，空腹服，以平为期。（《医学正传》鸡屎醴）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-rc8frca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-rc8frca","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治茎中有石：取鸡屎白半升，暴干，熬之令香，捣筛为散。以酪浆饮方寸匕，日三服，到一、二日当下石。（《范汪方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-bpyo38a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-bpyo38a","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治小儿血淋：鸡矢尖白如粉者，炒研，糊丸绿豆大。每服三、五丸，酒下四、五次。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-x81zxm3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-x81zxm3","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治身体角弓反张，四肢不随，烦乱欲死者：清酒五升，鸡白矢一升（捣、筛）。合和扬之千遍，乃饮之，大人服一升，日三，少小五合。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-xxis2t3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-xxis2t3","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治产后中风及百病，并男子中一切风：鸡粪一升（熬令黄），乌豆一升（熬令声绝不焦）。上二味，以清酒三升半，先淋鸡粪，次淋豆取汁，一服一升，温服取汗，病重者凡四、五日服之。（《千金方》鸡粪酒）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-1gc26gp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-1gc26gp","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治转筋之为病，其人臂脚直，脉上下行，微弦，转筋入腹者：鸡屎白，为散，取方寸匕，以水六合，和温服。（《金匮要略》鸡屎白散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-92tt6ol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-92tt6ol","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治妒乳及痈：鸡屎为末，服方寸匕，须臾，三服。（《经效产宝》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-ii608i7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-ii608i7","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治瘰疬瘘横阔作头状，若杏仁形：雄鸡屎灰，腊月猪脂和封之。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-gwvivml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-gwvivml","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治黄疸：鸡矢白、小豆、秫米各二分。捣筛为末，分为三服，黄汁当出，此通治面目黄。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-0530rxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-0530rxb","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治反胃吐食：乌骨鸡一只，与水饮四、五日，勿与食，将五蒲蛇二条，竹刀切与食，待鸡下粪，取阴干，为末，水丸米粟大，每服一分，桃仁汤下五、七服。（《证治发明》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-jly98q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-jly98q8","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治耳聋：鸡矢白半升（熬令黄色），乌豆一升（熬令爆声绝）。上二味，先取无灰酒二升，及热以沃之，良久，滤去滓，分温服，厚取汗.其耳如鼓稗，勿讶。（孟诜《必效方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-xyhw9no","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-xyhw9no","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治产后小便不禁：鸡屎烧作灰研细；空腹，酒服方寸匕。（《广济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-nmz43x7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-nmz43x7","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治小儿腹胀黄瘦：干鸡矢一两，丁香一钱。为末，蒸饼丸，小豆大，每米汤下十丸，日三服。（《活幼全书》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-b5vv8w5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-b5vv8w5","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-mnzw9p5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-mnzw9p5","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疗肩关节周围炎"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-yf37q7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-yf37q7w","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取鸡屎、麦麸各半斤，放锅内用慢火炒热时加入酒精，混匀后用布包好敷于患处，热散后取下。次日可再炒热后加酒精使用，连用4～5次后弃去。每日1次，7～10天为一疗程。治疗肩关节周围炎15例，有的病程近3年，经治7次即愈，观察2年未再复发。此外，亦用于治疗腰肌劳损，急性腰扭伤及其他关节炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-9n2mmm2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-9n2mmm2","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗破伤风"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-85zpmbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-85zpmbl","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取鸡矢白焙干，研成细末，成人每次3钱，以黄酒2两冲服，每日2次；如服用此量不能控制病情时，可加倍应用。小儿用量酌减。临床试治数十例，一般服药出汗后，诸症即减。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-xthzxzl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-xthzxzl","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治疗角膜斑痕"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-y64mols","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-y64mols","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将公鸡粪焙干，取白色部分研末，按每0.1克与人乳2毫升的比例混合制成白色乳剂。装入滴眼瓶内滴眼（人乳易变性，最好用时配制），1天4～6次。用时必须摇匀。同时配用蚕衣或蝉衣冲茶服。治疗43例，疗效尚好；有1例双目角膜斑翳，治疗40天，视力由半尺指数增进到1.0，观察已半年，未见退步，且白斑已大部吸收成为很薄的云翳；有的角膜白斑很厚，经治54天角膜大部分透明，只留下轻度混浊，视力由0.03进步到0.1。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-5hpever","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-5hpever","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-7sf965z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-7sf965z","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草经疏》：\"鸡屎白、微寒。《素问》云：心腹满，旦食不能暮食，名为臌胀。治之以鸡矢醴，一剂知，二剂已。王太仆注云：《本草》鸡矢并不治蛊胀，但能利小便，盖蛊胀皆生于湿热，湿热胀满，则小便不利。鸡屎能通利下泄，则湿热从小便而出，臌胀自愈。故曰治湿不利小便，非其治也。《本经》主石淋，利小便，止遗溺者，正此意耳。转筋者，血热也；伤寒寒热及消渴者，热在阳明也；瘢痕者，血热壅滞肌肉也；寒能总除诸热，故主之也。《日华子》炒服治中风失音痰迷，陈藏器和黑豆炒酒浸服治贼风风痹，盖风为刚邪，因热而生，鸡屎寒能除热，鸡本与风木之气相通，取共治本从类之义也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-ik5php1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-ik5php1","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《长沙药解》：\"鸡屎白，性微寒，利水而泄热，达木而舒筋。《金匮》鸡屎白散治转筋为病，臂脚直，脉上下微弦，转筋入腹。筋司于肝，水寒土湿，肝木不舒，筋木挛急，则病转筋。鸡屎白利水道而泄湿寒，则木达而筋舒也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-lcsamh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-lcsamh9","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《医林纂要》：\"鸡屎用雄者。《内经》以鸡矢醴治蛊胀，取其降浊气，燥脾湿，软坚去积，又能下达以去太阴之结，且能杀百蛊毒。凡小儿食癖皆可随所嗜作引以治之。打跌伤，酒和鸡屎白饮之，瘀即散而筋骨续矣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-uet1rkb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-uet1rkb","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614111821-5osa9t8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111821-5osa9t8","updated":"20240614111821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111823-7x58rfq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111823-7x58rfq"}},{"ID":"20240614111824-5yhxmla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111824-5yhxmla"}}]}